        "text": "Justice Kagan asked how often insanity defenses are raised and how often juries actually find insanity in the 46 states that retain the rule."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Gorsuch",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "1d40d0ab8170cbb6c4996025f0fa3af3283ebdc9e3052ffa247f1286c63efd94",
            "evidence_ids": [
