            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 24,
              "start": 24
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Gorsuch asked how far the insanity defense must be extended as a matter of due process \u2013 whether to all homicides, all felonies, or where the line should be drawn."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Sotomayor",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "1d40d0ab8170cbb6c4996025f0fa3af3283ebdc9e3052ffa247f1286c63efd94",
            "evidence_ids": [
