            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 68,
              "start": 68
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Alito, justice Alito further questioned whether the 18th\u2011century understanding of the human mind, which lacked modern psychiatry, should affect the analysis of insanity defenses."
      }
